WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.658 line:92% size:92%
It all starts in the soil of Central America.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.840 line:92% size:92%
Our native strains come from Panama, Nicaragua and Honduras.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.829 line:92% size:92%
We have programmes for rice, peanut, coffee, tomato and tobacco.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:18.343 line:92% size:92%
We also support sugar cane, maize, vegetables and fruit trees.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.500 line:92% size:92%
In rice, the programme starts from the seed.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.618 line:92% size:92%
And throughout the cycle, zero days of residue.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:32.238 line:92% size:92%
Our organic certifications for Europe, the United States and Japan help your harvest reach those markets.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.653 line:92% size:92%
And our distributors reach Latin America and the Caribbean.

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.318 line:92% size:92%
Demeter: from the soil to your table.
